<p className="mb-3">
  I/We <span 
    className={`highlight-field ${watch("ownerName") ? "auto-populated" : ""}`}
    style={{ fontWeight: 'bold !important', fontStyle: 'italic !important' }}
  >
    <strong><em>{watch("ownerName") || "[Owner Name]"}</em></strong>
  </span> residing permanently at{" "}
  <span 
    className={`highlight-field ${watch("address") ? "auto-populated" : ""}`}
    style={{ fontWeight: 'bold !important', fontStyle: 'italic !important' }}
  >
    <strong><em>{watch("address") || "[Address of Owner]"}</em></strong>
  </span> having original place of business at{" "}
  <span 
    className={`highlight-field ${watch("originalPlaceOfBusiness") ? "auto-populated" : ""}`}
    style={{ fontWeight: 'bold !important', fontStyle: 'italic !important' }}
  >
    <strong><em>{watch("originalPlaceOfBusiness") || "[Place of Business]"}</em></strong>
  </span>
</p>

<p className="mb-3">
  do hereby declare that vessel named <span 
    className={`highlight-field ${watch("vesselName") ? "auto-populated" : ""}`}
    style={{ fontWeight: 'bold !important', fontStyle: 'italic !important' }}
  >
    <strong><em>{watch("vesselName") || "[Vessel Name]"}</em></strong>
  </span> was built at{" "}
  <span 
    className={`highlight-field ${watch("placeOfBuild") ? "auto-populated" : ""}`}
    style={{ fontWeight: 'bold !important', fontStyle: 'italic !important' }}
  >
    <strong><em>{watch("placeOfBuild") || "[Place of Build]"}</em></strong>
  </span>
</p>

<p className="mb-3">
  in the year <span 
    className={`highlight-field ${watch("vesselyearOfBuild") ? "auto-populated" : ""}`}
    style={{ fontWeight: 'bold !important', fontStyle: 'italic !important' }}
  >
    <strong><em>{watch("vesselyearOfBuild") || "[Year of Build]"}</em></strong>
  </span> and was purchased by me on{" "}
  {isDeclarationEditable ? (
    <InputText
      name="workOrderDate"
      type="date"
      register={register("workOrderDate")}
      errors={errors}
      clearErrors={clearErrors}
      className="d-inline-block"
      style={{ 
        width: "auto", 
        display: "inline-block",
        minWidth: "150px",
        margin: "0 4px"
      }}
    />
  ) : (
    <span 
      className="highlight-field editable-field"
      style={{ fontWeight: 'bold !important', fontStyle: 'italic !important' }}
    >
      <strong><em>{watch("workOrderDate") || "[Work Order Date]"}</em></strong>
    </span>
  )}
  {" "}for rupees <span 
    className={`highlight-field ${watch("workOrderValue") ? "auto-populated" : ""}`}
    style={{ fontWeight: 'bold !important', fontStyle: 'italic !important' }}
  >
    <strong><em>{watch("workOrderValue") || "[Work Order Value]"}</em></strong>
  </span> and wish to have the same registered in my name at the port of{" "}
  <span 
    className={`highlight-field ${watch("nameOfRegistry") ? "auto-populated" : ""}`}
    style={{ fontWeight: 'bold !important', fontStyle: 'italic !important' }}
  >
    <strong><em>{watch("nameOfRegistry") || "[Port of Registry]"}</em></strong>
  </span> and that I am the owner of the same.
</p>
